              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-GitHub-Event", "value": "ping" },
              { "key": "X-Hub-Signature-256", "value": "{{webhook_signature}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{webhook_raw_body}}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/webhooks/github",
            "description": "The folder pre-request script signs the exact raw JSON bytes sent here with the private webhook_secret. GitHub-style sha256=<hex> uses HMAC-SHA256 over the UTF-8 body. This benign ping event has no repository or commit data, so the background handler skips graph work. HTTP 202 confirms authentication and scheduling, not successful background completion. Never commit the secret."
